+# Chapter 2 additional art audit (2026-10-26)
+
+Current fixed assets: 11 backgrounds, 2 details, 12 character portraits, 9 enemies, 1 captive event = 35. Player partner and Morii reuse existing assets. Additional names below are proposals, not registered runtime references.
+
+| Priority | Asset | Existing scene | Proposed path | Suggested size |
+|---|---|---|---|---|
+| High | Farmer neutral full-body | 4 (dry canal), 21 (restored water) | images/chapter2/characters/ch2_farmer_normal.png | 1024×1536 transparent PNG |
+| High | Waterway manager neutral full-body | 6,12,13,21,22 | images/chapter2/characters/ch2_manager_normal.png | 1024×1536 transparent PNG |
+| Recommended | Saya and Toyoyo fleeing | Scene 2 lines 0–3; before player joins at line 5 | images/chapter2/events/ch2_escape.png | 1536×1024 landscape |
+| Optional | Watermill rear stairs | Scene 7 first narration; currently underground background | images/chapter2/backgrounds/ch2_watermill_steps.png | 1536×1024 landscape |
+| Optional | Manager and workers closing inlet | Scene 21 lines 1–3 | images/chapter2/events/ch2_inlet_repair.png | 1536×1024 landscape |
+| Optional | Farmer/manager smiles | Scene 21 after water returns | characters/ch2_farmer_happy.png, ch2_manager_happy.png | Same canvas/pose as neutral |
+
+No new events required. Escape image must use approved Saya/Toyoyo designs and worried expressions, show approaching black fog behind them, and omit player/selected partner. A complete event illustration is enough; separate running sprites are optional, not also required. Existing captives/enemy layers cover final-boss capture and rescue; do not regenerate. Ancient records already have two dedicated detail images. Scene 13 partner-dependent play should not be baked into a fixed event image.
+
+Renderer fix: retain story stage only when parentNode is app, not merely isConnected (battle stage belongs to nested .battle). Morii persists throughout scenes with a Morii line and is hidden in other scenes; this is presentation, not a new story departure. Narration in both chapters uses label 情景, upright serif and border, not Japanese italics.
+
+Validation: old insertBefore bug reproduced in strict DOM harness; all 9 victory transitions and all 23 scene casts tested. Normal saves/learning data untouched by the DOM change. Existing error should be recoverable by reloading; do not clear site data.
